==== stdout ====
Usage: raphael logout [--json]

Remove the saved login from this machine.

Deletes the saved login file after checking that its directory is yours and
private. Nothing on the server changes.

With no saved login, says so and exits 0.

RAPHAEL_ENDPOINT and RAPHAEL_API_KEY are not changed; when they are set,
commands keep using them, and logout warns.

Options:
      --json
          Print the result as one JSON document.
  -h, --help
          Show help.

Examples:
  raphael logout
  raphael logout --json

Prints:
  What was removed, or that there was nothing to remove. JSON has removed,
  endpoint (null when unknown) and configFile.

Next: raphael login

See also: raphael help connecting
